        "id": 1406251
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-12T03:43:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checking line814 which reconfigures the ipv6 route info, looks it should be safer to call this func multiple times. Actually NetdUtils.tetherInterface does the similar things, configure different prefix as route info associated with the interface. untetherInterface looks like also do something cleanup work (e.g. switch IPv6 from router to client mode), but not very sure if we should do that even if NCM is still on?",
      "parentUuid": "b8ba4b16_6e9f3d07",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 989,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 989,
